{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The self-guided app for statues information spread throughout Bali"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.tudemaha.arca\/documentation\/Arca","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bali is rich in culture and one of them is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"patung","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (English: statue). Arca provides comprehensive statue information spread throughout Bali, allowing you to explore the way you want - super simple and convenient!"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Discover Bali’s cultural heritage through an interactive, audio-guided experience that brings the stories of ancient statues to life. Whether you’re a tourist exploring for the first time or a local wanting to learn more about your cultural heritage, Arca makes statue discovery accessible and engaging.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Key Features","anchor":"Key-Features","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"text":"Self-Guided Audio Tour","anchor":"Self-Guided-Audio-Tour","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arca provides an interactive audio-based tour guide for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patung"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" nearby. With just one click, tour mode is activated for you. The audio tour even works while you listen to music - Arca speaks the information about the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patung"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" you pass on the road.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Detailed Patung Information","anchor":"Detailed-Patung-Information","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Curious about the story and history behind a "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"patung","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"? Arca provides comprehensive statue information including:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Name and cultural significance"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Physical dimensions and materials"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Construction year and historical context"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sculptor information and artistic details"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Stories and legends associated with each statue"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Awareness-Pocket-Guide","text":"Awareness Pocket Guide","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Patung","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in Bali are not just monuments - they are integral parts of Balinese rituals and spiritual life. Arca categorizes statues into:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ritual Category"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Sacred statues used in ceremonies and religious practices","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Monumental Category"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Historical and cultural landmarks","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Bookmark-Your-Patung","text":"Bookmark Your Patung","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Save statues that resonate with you or hold emotional significance. Create your personal collection for easy access and future visits."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"